{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, סְלֵק","hw":"סְלֵק","html":"† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">סְלֵק</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. come up (</strong>Aramaic loan-word in BH, q.v.<strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Pe.</strong>  Pf. 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">סִלְקַת</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:20\" href=\"/Daniel.7.20\">Dn 7:20</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ת—ַ</span>(!) v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:8\" href=\"/Daniel.7.8\">8</a> (K<sup>§ 25 b)</sup>); 3 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">סְלִ֫קוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:29\" href=\"/Daniel.2.29\">2:29</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:12\" href=\"/Ezra.4.12\">Ezr 4:12</a>; Pt. fpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">סָֽלְקָן</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:3\" href=\"/Daniel.7.3\">Dn 7:3</a>;—<em>come up</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן</span> pers. <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:12\" href=\"/Ezra.4.12\">Ezr 4:12</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן־יַמָּא</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:3\" href=\"/Daniel.7.3\">Dn 7:3</a>; abs. of horn in vision <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:8\" href=\"/Daniel.7.8\">7:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:20\" href=\"/Daniel.7.20\">20</a>; fig. of thoughts <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:29\" href=\"/Daniel.2.29\">2:29</a>.<br><strong>Haph.</strong>  <em>lift, take up:</em> Pf. 3 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַסִּ֫קוּ</span> (as if from <span dir=\"rtl\">נסק</span>; K<sup>§ 44 b)</sup>) <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:22\" href=\"/Daniel.3.22\">Dn 3:22</a>; Inf. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְהַנְסָקָה</span> (K<sup>l.c.</sup> Str<sup>§ 3 h</sup>) <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:24\" href=\"/Daniel.6.24\">6:24</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">מִן</span> loc.), both c. ל acc. pers.<br><strong>Hoph.</strong>  (W<sup>CG 225</sup>) <em>be taken up:</em> Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">הֻסַּק</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:24\" href=\"/Daniel.6.24\">6:24</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">מִן</span> loc.).","next":"BDB Aramaic, סְעַד","prev":"BDB Aramaic, סוּפֹּנְיָה"}